+/**
+ * wave-26 lane WWS — the inter-INLINE whitespace predicate, LIFTED out of
+ * HARNESS_OPTIONS.renderChildSeparator by wave-54 lane L6 (unit RS) as a
+ * pure export, so the composed canvas can ask the SAME question one level
